# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE ON results/ AND *.pt
#
# The rules above ignore NEW files under results/ and new checkpoints. They do
# not untrack what is already committed: 18,126 files under results/ and 502
# .pt checkpoints are tracked deliberately, because commit 68aaf062 (tag
# paper-tiv-v1) is cited in the accompanying paper as the provenance for every
# reported number.
#
# Do not "clean up" those files. See REPO_AUDIT.md before changing anything
# here. If you add a new result that should be versioned, force it:
#     git add -f results/<path>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
